'''Sojiro Seta''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that can be obtained from the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Rurouni Kenshin Collaboration Event/Gacha Drop|Rurouni Kenshin Collaboration Event]]. He was added in [[Version 15.7 Update|Version 15.7]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 879
|rarity = UR
|name1 = Sojiro Seta
|name2 = Sojiro Seta CC
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Sojiro Seta CC''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Sojiro Seta is a standard backline crowd-controller. The uptime on his [[Special Abilities#Slow|Slow]]/[[Special Abilities#Weaken|Weaken]] sits at a comfortable ~50%/~77% against targets hit by all 3 [[Special Abilities#Multi-Hit|Multi-Hits]], making him a solid cc option against the notoriously aggressive Angels and Darks. His best use case is against high-DPS melee and midrange pushers like [[Boraphim]], [[Winged Pigge]], [[Bun Bun Black]], as well as the tanky peon megaspam that plagues much of both traits (e.g. massive spontaneous waves of [[Dark Otter]]s, [[Angelic Gory|Angelic Gories]], [[Shadow Boxer K]]s, etc.). He has good survivability, boasting 5 knockbacks, albeit with subpar HP reminiscent of [[Ururun Wolf (Special Cat)|Awakened Ururun]]. Suffice to say, he's basically unusable if a stage features any kind of enemy that can snipe him, and his disappointing display of resistances don't help with that either. He works fine enough, but isn't anything to write home about, so just use him if the situation calls for it.

{{Job|Classification = Crowd-Controller & Backliner}}

